{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. I understand we need to hold a coverage huddle for the Advanced Chemistry teacher's upcoming three-day absence next month. Before we can post anything to staff, I'll need to review and approve both the coverage roster and the instructional plan. I believe we have a draft plan that uses a single substitute, regular classroom activities, and the standard make-up-work process — but I'd like to hear from each of you on whether there are any relevant updates or concerns I should know about before I make my decision. Let's start with the department chair."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to flag a concern with the draft plan. My department calendar shows that the class's graded chemistry lab practical is scheduled for the second day of the absence, and it cannot be replaced by a worksheet. Department policy requires a chemistry-certified teacher to supervise it. I entered the practical in the department calendar this week, but I had not yet forwarded the calendar note to Ms. Morgan, so she may not have been aware of this when reviewing the draft."}
```

